YOUNG AND NAOVE: MEMOIRS OF A NEWBIE
by Chendailem

It seems as if an eternity has passed since one joined the amazing world of
  NannyMUD. And, looking back, one remembers how many things one didn't
  understand back then.

Following is a list of things I vaguely remember thinking back then. I assume
  everybody has one of these, one more embarrassing than the other, but here,
  for your pleasure, is mine.



- "I'm not too fond of alcohol, so I think I'll try finding other ways to heal."

- "I'm sure it's fully possible to be awesome in this game without using
  violence all the time. I'll stick to the non-violence quests, I think, I'm
  not very good at fights."

- "I can't kill that NPC -- he's a HUMAN! I can't go around killing humans, can
  I?"

- "Darn! The shop is out of money AGAIN!"

- "Oh, hello! Always fun running into a fellow mudder. So, what are you up to?
  Anything interesting around here? What did you say your name was -- Harry,
  was it?"

- "If I keep playing intensely a couple of hours every day for four or five
  years, maybe I'll have enough points to become a paragon!"

- "Woohoo, Adventurers is the most awesome guild ever! We have the KICK spell!
  Awesome!"

- "When I become a wizard, I'll build an amazing two-hundred-room area which
  makes everybody come running! And I'll make weapons and armours with no
  drawbacks at all! And I'll put it on ANTHARIS, that place is awesome!"

- [shouted:] "My English sucks, can anyone tell me how to put out a torch?"

- "YEAH, I solved the 'Give the Orc slayer to Leo' quest! And I only had to
  heal three or four times! Hm, I wonder if I should try 'Slay lag' next..."

- "Heck, there's no way I'm trying the 'Year of Banshee' quest. That's a 220
  point quest, that's probably way too difficult!"

- "Look at that, a transparent ring just lying there on the ground! I wonder
  what happens if I put it on..."

- [shouted:] "I'm at [directions], and someone has dropped a huge pile of
  armour and money and valuables here. Does it belong to anyone, or could I
  take it?"

- "I'm glad we have the village smithy. I mean, where else would people get
  their weapons?"

- "That kobold cave must be one of the most difficult places in the entire mud!"

And finally, a thought I bet everybody has had at one point:
- "Oooh, a lemming. Even *I* can kill that!"

